\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n+no}{\PYGZdq{}But I negatived that idea. I myself, I explained, had looked under the bed. }
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n+no}{And the manager had opened the doors of the wardrobe. }
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n+no}{There was nowhere else where a man could hide. }
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n+no}{It is true the hat cupboard was locked in the middle of the wardrobe, }
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n+no}{but as that was only a shallow affair with shelves, no one could have been concealed there.\PYGZdq{}}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{p+pIndicator}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n+nt}{description}\PYG{p}{:}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p+pIndicator}{|}\PYG{+w}{ }
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n+no}{You use your extensive knowledge of human nature, gleaned from your small\PYGZhy{}village life, to solve complex mysteries. }
