\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n+no}{\PYGZdq{}The only thing I ever said was that human nature is much the same in a village as anywhere else, only one has opportunities and leisure for seeing it at closer quarters\PYGZdq{}}
\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{p+pIndicator}{\PYGZhy{}}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{n+nt}{description}\PYG{p}{:}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{p+pIndicator}{|}\PYG{+w}{ }
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n+no}{Your investigative method is characterized by your keen observation skills and your ability to draw parallels between the people and situations you encounter in your investigations and those from your small village life. }
